      <span class="terminal-dot"></span><span class="terminal-dot"></span><span class="terminal-dot"></span>
      <span class="terminal-title">eluru@iisc — profile</span>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal-body">
      <h1 id="identity-heading" class="mobile-name">Eluru<br />Sai Venkat</h1>
      <pre class="ascii-name" aria-label="Eluru Sai Venkat">
███████╗██╗     ██╗   ██╗██████╗ ██╗   ██╗
██╔════╝██║     ██║   ██║██╔══██╗██║   ██║
█████╗  ██║     ██║   ██║██████╔╝██║   ██║
██╔══╝  ██║     ██║   ██║██╔══██╗██║   ██║
███████╗███████╗╚██████╔╝██║  ██║╚██████╔╝
╚══════╝╚══════╝ ╚═════╝ ╚═╝  ╚═╝ ╚═════╝

███████╗ █████╗ ██╗    ██╗   ██╗███████╗███╗   ██╗██╗  ██╗ █████╗ ████████╗
██╔════╝██╔══██╗██║    ██║   ██║██╔════╝████╗  ██║██║ ██╔╝██╔══██╗╚══██╔══╝
███████╗███████║██║    ██║   ██║█████╗  ██╔██╗ ██║█████╔╝ ███████║   ██║
╚════██║██╔══██║██║    ╚██╗ ██╔╝██╔══╝  ██║╚██╗██║██╔═██╗ ██╔══██║   ██║
███████║██║  ██║██║     ╚████╔╝ ███████╗██║ ╚████║██║  ██╗██║  ██║   ██║
╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝      ╚═══╝  ╚══════╝╚═╝  ╚═══╝╚═╝  ╚═╝╚═╝  ╚═╝   ╚═╝</pre
      >

      <div class="terminal-section">
        <span class="terminal-label">$ cat current.txt</span>
        <p>
          Second-year <strong>M.Tech in Artificial Intelligence</strong> student at the{" "}<strong
            >Representation Learning Lab (RepLab), IISc Bengaluru</strong
          > · Aug 2025–Present.<br />
          Advised by <a href="https://prathosh.in/">Dr. Prathosh A.P.</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal-section">
        <span class="terminal-label">$ cat previous.txt</span>
        <p>
          Intern, LatentForce AI · May 2026–Jul 2026<br />
          Samsung R&amp;D Institute, Delhi · Jul 2023–Nov 2024<br />
          B.Tech in Electrical Engineering, IIT Madras · Graduated 2023
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal-section">
        <span class="terminal-label">$ ls research_interests/</span>
        <ul class="interest-list">
          <li>Self-Improving Agents</li>
          <li>Continual Learning</li>
          <li>Inference Optimization</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal-interactive">
        <div id="terminal-output" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <form id="terminal-form">
          <label for="terminal-command"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><span class="sr-only">Terminal command</span></label>
          <input
            id="terminal-command"
            name="command"
            type="text"
            autocomplete="off"
            spellcheck="false"
            placeholder="type help and press Enter"
          />
          <button type="submit" aria-label="Run command" title="Run command">↵</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="home-grid">
    <section>
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Latest writing</h2>
        <a href="/blog/">All posts →</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="post-list">
        <li>
          <span class="meta">Draft · Sequence Models</span>
          <h3><a href="/blog/rnns/">Recurrent Neural Networks</a></h3>
          <p>Why RNNs model sequences, matrix-calculus BPTT, recurrent gradient failure, and gated gradient paths.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

  </div>

  <script>
    const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>("#terminal-form");
    const input = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#terminal-command");
    const output = document.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>("#terminal-output");
    const routes: Record<string, string> = {
      academics: "/academics/",
      blog: "/blog/",
      publications: "/publications/",
      projects: "/projects/",
    };

    input?.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
      if (event.key !== "Enter") return;
      event.preventDefault();
      form?.requestSubmit();
    });

    form?.addEventListener("submit", (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      const command = input?.value.trim().toLowerCase() ?? "";
      if (!command || !output || !input) return;

      if (command === "clear") {
        output.replaceChildren();
      } else if (routes[command]) {
        window.location.href = routes[command];
      } else {
        const response = command === "help"
          ? "Commands: about, academics, blog, publications, projects, clear"
          : command === "about"
            ? "Eluru Sai Venkat — M.Tech AI, RepLab, IISc"
            : `Unknown command: ${command}. Type help.`;
        const line = document.createElement("p");
        line.textContent = `$ ${command}\n${response}`;
        output.append(line);
      }

      input.value = "";
      input.focus();
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
